    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">All </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">digital</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> downloads</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">,</span> <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">shirts</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and</span> <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/filter-outreach\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">outreach material</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on</span> <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">DrGreger.org</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> are 20 percent off until tomorrow, August 27! Proceeds go to support</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NutritionFacts.org</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We are thrilled to debut our new</span> <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/filter-diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">diversity shirt</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">! We have long stressed the importance of dietary diversity. Each plant family has a unique combination of phytonutrients, which is one of the reasons I developed the</span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/daily-dozen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Daily Dozen</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to encourage eating a variety of the very best foods each day for health and longevity. We also continue to share life-saving, life-changing science-based information to communities around the world, which is why everything on our</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">website</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is free and all of our videos are translated into multiple languages. We’re thankful we get to take part in helping to make the world a more healthful place for everyone. All of the proceeds from the sale of our new</span> <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/filter-diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">diversity shirt</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> will support </span><a href=\"https://foodispower.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Food Empowerment Project</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, a nonprofit food justice organization.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get your shirt</span> <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/merch/filter-diversity\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Volume 55 Out Now</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-68380 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner-1024x582.jpg\" alt=\"volume 55\" width=\"215\" height=\"122\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner-1024x582.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner-960x546.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner-768x437.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner-1200x682.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner-720x409.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner-540x307.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Vol-55-Download-Banner.jpg 1900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a>My new volume of videos is out today and covers mushrooms, mycotoxins, fasting, bariatric surgery, and more. It is </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">available</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> as a streaming video so you can start watching it immediately. Each video in this new collection will be released online over the next few months, all available for free, of course, but if you don’t want to wait, you can watch all of them by streaming </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">right now</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">And, remember, if you watch the videos on </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">NutritionFacts.org</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/NutritionFactsOrg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, you can access captions in several different languages. To find yours, click on the settings wheel in the lower-right of the video and then “Subtitles/CC.” Happy viewing!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are a $25+ monthly supporter, you’d be an expert on these new topics by now, having already received a complimentary link to the new download. If you’d like to receive them before they’re available to the public, please consider becoming a monthly supporter.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sign up on the </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">donation page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to become a $25+ monthly contributor, and be given an opportunity to receive early access to the newest downloads for free as long as your contributions are current. We’re so appreciative of each one of our donors. Without your support, we wouldn’t be able to continue our work. </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Key Takeaways: Flaxseeds</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-68374 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"flaxseeds on spoon on light background\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/Flax-Isolated-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>I include a tablespoon of flaxseeds in my Daily Dozen checklist of the healthiest foods to eat each day. They’re a rich source of omega-3 fatty acids and cancer-fighting lignans. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Read more on our </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/flax-seeds/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and check out videos like </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/benefits-of-flaxseed-meal-for-weight-loss/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Benefits of Flaxseed Meal for Weight Loss</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/flaxseed-vs-diabetes/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flax Seeds vs. Diabetes</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b><br/>\n</b><b>Recipe: Buffalo Cauliflower with Ranch Dressing</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-68372 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"cauliflower buffalo wings and carrot sticks on dark background\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/buffalo-wings-540x540.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Looking for a delicious way to snack on some crucifers? Get the free recipe </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/buffalo-cauliflower-with-ranch-dressing/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, originally published in my </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-die-cookbook/\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Not to Die Cookbook</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and watch how it’s made on our </span><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/CKPljQvg9Sl/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instagram</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.  </span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Outreach Cards in English and Spanish</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/spanish-outreach.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-68378 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/spanish-outreach.png\" alt=\"outreach cards\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/spanish-outreach.png 800w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/spanish-outreach-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/spanish-outreach-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/spanish-outreach-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/spanish-outreach-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Our outreach cards make it easy to tell your friends, colleagues, and family—or strangers!—about NutritionFacts.org. I’m happy to announce they are now also available in Spanish. (At this point, shipping is only available in the United States.) </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get your cards here: </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/swag/products/nutritionfacts-business-cards\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">English</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> | </span><a href=\"https://drgreger.org/products/nutritionfacts-org-outreach-business-cards-spanish-us-shipping-only\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spanish</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. </span></p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4><b>Volunteer Spotlight: María Belén Oliva</b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/IMG_20201027_180411-e1628791118889.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-68382 size-large alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/IMG_20201027_180411-e1628791118889-1024x1032.jpg\" alt=\"woman standing in front of a tree\" width=\"198\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/IMG_20201027_180411-e1628791118889-1024x1032.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/IMG_20201027_180411-e1628791118889-960x967.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/IMG_20201027_180411-e1628791118889-768x774.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/IMG_20201027_180411-e1628791118889-1200x1209.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/IMG_20201027_180411-e1628791118889-720x726.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/08/IMG_20201027_180411-e1628791118889-540x544.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 198px) 100vw, 198px\"/></a>“I’ve been volunteering as a translator/subtitler at NutritionFacts for some months now and I couldn’t be happier. I’m driven by my passion for food and wellbeing, and to be able to help spread such important content around the world with my translations is really inspiring!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It’s difficult to pick a favourite recipe, but I think it could be an Armenian salad with roasted eggplants, bell peppers, chestnuts, and raisins.”</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-60211\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png\" alt=\"Top 3 Videos of the Month\" width=\"460\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-1024x331.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-960x310.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-768x248.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-720x233.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month-540x174.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/08/Top-3-Videos-of-the-Month.png 1108w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 460px) 100vw, 460px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-67871 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"The Benefits of Moringa: Is It the Most Nutritious Food?\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-11-The-Benefits-of-Moringa-Is-It-the-Most-Nutritious-Food.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/the-benefits-of-moringa-is-it-the-most-nutritious-food/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Benefits of Moringa: Is It the Most Nutritious Food?</span></a> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Does the so-called miracle tree live up to the hype?</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-67960 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"200-Pound Weight Loss Without Hunger\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-15-200-Pound-Weight-Loss-Without-Hunger.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/200-pound-weight-loss-without-hunger/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">200-Pound Weight Loss Without Hunger</span></a> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I dive into one of the most fascinating series of studies I’ve ever come across.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-67883 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"Is it Safe to Eat Raw Mushrooms?\" width=\"215\" height=\"121\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms-960x540.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms-480x270.jpg 480w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms-720x405.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms-540x304.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/06/54-13-Is-it-Safe-to-Eat-Raw-Mushrooms.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 215px) 100vw, 215px\"/></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/is-it-safe-to-eat-raw-mushrooms/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Is It Safe to Eat Raw Mushrooms?</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Microwaving is probably the most efficient way to reduce agaritine levels in fresh mushrooms.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Live Q&amp;A on September 23 </b></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-53879 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Live Q&amp;A\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/05/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Every other month, I do a Q&amp;A live from my treadmill, and </span><b><i>September 23</i></b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is the next one.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Join on our </span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facebook</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> page or </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/NutritionfactsOrgMD/live\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> channel at 3pm EDT. I’ll be streaming to both at the same time!</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can find links to past live Q&amp;As </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/live/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on NutritionFacts.org. If that’s not enough, remember, I have an </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">audio podcast</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to keep you company, too.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
